<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Annual Director Resolution - <%= company.name %></title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: 'Helvetica', 'Arial', sans-serif; padding: 40px; line-height: 1.6; }
        h1 { text-align: center; font-size: 22px; text-decoration: underline; }
        h2 { text-align: center; font-size: 18px; margin-top: 10px; }
        .section { margin-top: 24px; }
        .clause { margin-bottom: 16px; text-align: justify; }
        .bold { font-weight: bold; }
        .signature { margin-top: 60px; }
        .sig-line { border-top: 1px solid #000; width: 280px; margin-top: 50px; padding-top: 4px; }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <h1>RESOLUTION OF THE DIRECTORS</h1>
    <h2><%= company.name %></h2>
    <p style="text-align: center;">(the "Corporation")</p>

    <div class="section">
        <p>The undersigned, being all the directors of the Corporation, hereby consent in writing to the
            following resolutions and certify that these resolutions have been duly passed:</p>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
        <div class="bold">1. CONFIRMATION OF DIRECTORS</div>
        <div class="clause">
            RESOLVED THAT the following persons, having consented to act, are confirmed as the directors of
            the Corporation:
            <ul>
                <% company.directors.forEach(function(director) { %>
                    <li><%= director.name %> &mdash; appointed <%= new Date(director.appointedDate).toLocaleDateString() %></li>
                <% }); %>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
        <div class="bold">2. REGISTERED OFFICE</div>
        <div class="clause">
            RESOLVED THAT the registered office of the Corporation shall continue to be located at
            <%= company.registeredOfficeAddress.street %>, <%= company.registeredOfficeAddress.city %>,
            <%= company.registeredOfficeAddress.province %> <%= company.registeredOfficeAddress.postalCode %>.
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
        <div class="bold">3. FINANCIAL STATEMENTS</div>
        <div class="clause">
            RESOLVED THAT the unaudited financial statements of the Corporation for the fiscal year ending
            <%= company.fiscalYearEnd || 'December 31' %> are hereby approved as presented to the directors,
            and the directors waive the requirement to appoint an auditor for the ensuing year pursuant to
            applicable corporate legislation.
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
        <div class="bold">4. GENERAL AUTHORIZATION</div>
        <div class="clause">
            RESOLVED THAT any one director or officer of the Corporation is hereby authorized to execute and
            deliver all such documents and to do all such acts and things as may be necessary or desirable to
            give effect to the foregoing resolutions.
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="signature">
        <p>DATED this <%= new Date().toLocaleDateString() %>.</p>
        <% company.directors.forEach(function(director) { %>
            <div class="sig-line"><%= director.name %>, Director</div>
        <% }); %>
    </div>
</body>

</html>
